        "sub": {
          "zh": "結合中西醫學理論，為頑疾患者提供高活性、純天然輔助方案",
          "en": "Integrating TCM & Western Medicine for high-active natural solutions"
        },
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "text": {
              "zh": "康草堂 (Wonder Herb Health Products Ltd) 是以人為本的中草藥製品公司，沿用中草藥附以西藥治療效益的前題，結合中西藥平衡理論，採用品質上乘且活性含量極高的中草藥，每一批次都經過加拿大及香港雙重檢測，確保活性含量水平，協助慢性頑疾患者改善健康。",
              "en": "Wonder Herb Health Products Ltd is a patient-focused herbal company, combining TCM and modern standards, using high-quality, high-active natural ingredients. Each batch is double-tested in Canada and Hong Kong to ensure active content levels."
            }
          },
          {
            "text": {
              "zh": "累積二十餘年經驗，協助各類頑疾患者舒緩療程不適，提升免疫力。",
              "en": "Over 20 years of experience, we help patients relieve treatment discomfort and boost immunity."
            }
          },
          {
            "text": {
              "zh": "康草堂的產品包括「雲芝糖肽精華 PSP」，T3，PT3 及乙肝清 。產品多樣性能切合不同人仕的需要。獨特配方有助提升常規治療效益。",
              "en": "Our products include Yunzhi PSP Essence, T3, PT3, and Hep BQ capsules. Unique formulas enhance conventional therapy."
            }
          },
          {
            "text": {
              "zh": "經大學研究證實，「康草堂雲芝糖肽精華 PSP + T3」的獨特配方，比單一服用雲芝糖肽精華PSP功效倍增。",
              "en": "University studies confirm that 'Wonder Herb Yunzhi PSP + T3' formula doubles efficacy compared to single PSP."
